{
  "id": "DEU.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 3",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli ghwajoar sugoocheanda siguura Ogu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean geayamnyi geat ak geayaachi naweeda weah Bashani, nea Ogu was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Bashani ghwahidu gang'ucheeweasa, niny ea fugaaschi sean, eeng'ucheena aba Edreyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Adiidu giiwali; aba gideaba niyanyi niny ea fugaaschi sean ea ng'eanyiidaanyi sean geatingaagu; ak gaysimana gida ghayi isimi Sihoni was sugoocheanda fuga Amori ghayi abiita Heshboni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA ghwayiin bugusteanya eara Ogu, was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Bashani ea fugaaschi sean; geeng'ucheewi ea goosha sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeghaschi mujiinajeagaaschi sean aba damandida nea ea manda mujiineeda meaghasi, mujiinajeega was laadam, ng'eanyiida sean bea Argobu was heeda ambal Ogu aba Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mujiinajeega sean geejabwa hilooga geawi, ea gidaghuudajeega sirada gharinga hang'oonyi, murdeeda gharang'weaka meajabwana hilooga geawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geebwarji sean gawuurji gisisimi Sihoni was sugoocheanda Heshboni, geedataschi gilinyoo ea mujiini gil, headiga ea gadeemga ea diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geayaachi dugwa ea haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda mujiini ghoah gaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'waanyi ng'eanyiida aba damandida aba geatinga sugoodi iyeenya bea fuga Amori mida giigheawda Yordani, sing'eada moangoachiyda Arnoni ea gagul giijeeda Hermoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(nea fuga Sidoni gaguura Hermoni Siriyoni aba fuga Amori gaguura Sinuri), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea mujiinajeega sean bea ng'eanyiida awiida ea ng'eanyiida sean bea Gileyadi ea Bashani, ea ghwahita Saleka ea Edreyi, mujiinajeega was heeda ambaliischeewa Ogu aba Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Hean geeghus Ogu was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Bashani, geeghus niny aba fuga Refayimu, ng'ula, bulaliidaanyi geesina bulaliida sisna lagheanga; nea ea manda ng'eanyiida Raba bea fuga Amoni, nea geawundaanyi gaba geatin shageash nea wiiloadaanyi geegala geatin ang'wan, geegala geatinda siida.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eemoojiga may gayeewda Yordani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean nea sighaschi ng'eanyiida aba damandida, ghaadawji jeacheenga Rubeni ea Gadi ng'eanyiida ng'eada Aroeri, mida moonghooda burgadeeda Arnoni, ea bugusta ng'eanyiida giijeega bea Gileyadi ea mujiinajeagaaschi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heeda siipuuti bea Gileyadi ea ng'eanyiida sean bea Bashani, ea heeda ambaliischeewa NG'UTAMIIDA was Ogu, was ng'eanyiida sean bea Argobu, ghaadawji gwahearan eemeeda silach bugusta bea Manase. (Nea ng'eanyiida sean bea Bashani geeguura ng'eanyiida fuga Refayimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yairi was orjeeda Manase ghamughuta ng'eanyiida sean bea Argobu, was Bashani ea gagul moonghooda fuga Geshuri ea Maaka ak gang'assa gharang'weakiga gheawungaaschi, Hawot-yairi, ak gwasunu ea ghoah ghamneawa). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida Makiri ghaadawji Gileyadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea jeacheenga Rubeni ea Gadi ghaadawji goombal gidang'eada Gileyadi ea gagul moangoachiyda Arnoni, ea bugusta moangoachi was moonghooda ea ghwahita eenda Yaboki, hean was moonghooda jeacheenga Amori; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea eara ng'eanyiida Araba, ea Yordani ea moonghoadaanyi, ng'eada Ginereti ea gagul basooda Araba, basooda balang'da mida geeshta giijeeda siguura Bisga laabwa heeda ghayeawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean gearukusi aba damandida ak geayeeshi ‘NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, nigooneegwa oombala ng'eanyiini; nea gheareemanga was gheajiroodiga gayghoaghaaw gaweay madeeda gheareemanga mideawa ng'utkeaka, was buweadeegeagwa bea fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata gadeemgeagwa, ea diibigeagwa ea dugweagwa (ghwanal gideaba goondeawi dugwa saang'a) gaygoobiida jeeda mujiinajeega eagoonyeegwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwak ea ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA buweadeegeagwa fuufeanda, gawuurjeeweegwa, nea goombali ng'eanyiida adaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA giigheawda Yordani ama ng'ata gaygaba siisi biikta heeda ambaliischeewa was heeda agoonyeegwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayeeshi Yoshuwa aba damandida, ‘nidaahi aba gheanyangaagu gidahinda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA sugoodi iyeenya, hean ea gicha gwasin gil aba jeeda ng'eanyoojiga jea ookeawsiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoabeali; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gaygang'uchi aba badahuukeagwa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa meatawa beata jea ghwahita Ganaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean geamearmearanayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba damandida nea geayeeshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ghamneawa niing'eadi ahiimsiina soomjeandaang'u hawundaang'u ea geatindaang'u bea uurda, nea mandana humng'eeda ghana ea ng'eanyi gil aseeta ammu gwasin gadiyoojiga hees iisini ang'iing'i? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuscheey goonean beata daaghaaw, dadaah ng'eanyiida miy mida giigheawda Yordani, was ng'eanyiida miy bea heayeeniga ea Lebanoni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanyareeksean NG'UTAMIIDA aba ramaseanyeekeagwa ak ea mudu gooleeysinean iita, ak gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Nihit adiidu gibiikti rukuni ng'asheanji gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ding'da uhuuda giijeeda Bisga gatgada gheanyangaagu ak ging'ulayi heeda biyeara ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara ea heeda ghayeawa, asi ng'ula aba gheanyangaagu, ang'iing'i majaghaawana eenda Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
